B.QZ=s(["Fingerstyle: thumb takes the bass, other fingers take the words.","Travis picking alternates a bass note on 1 and 3 with the middle strings on 2 and 4.","Any chord can be picked slowly to find out what it is made of."],t.s)
B.VA=new A.k5(B.QZ)
B.P1=s(["A dot after a note adds half of it again: a dotted quarter is 1 and a half beats.","Two notes joined by a tie are played as one long note.",'Strumming uses the same maths: eighth notes mean the pick changes direction on every "and".'],t.s)
